  "description": ".NET for Android bindings for the Agora IoT Android SDK, generated from io.agora:iotsdk 1.3.0 on Maven Central. Lets a .NET app pair with, call and control Agora IoT devices. Three things to know before adopting it: Android only (Agora ships no iOS IoT SDK, so there is no cross-platform client); mutually exclusive with the Video, Voice and Signaling packages, whose native artifacts it bundles its own copies of; and its device-messaging features route through AWS IoT Core, whose Android SDK has no .NET binding and would have to be supplied separately.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
